","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/513269/66899513269.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2019","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/513269/5132690319.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2018","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/513269/5132690318.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2017","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/513269/5132690317.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2016","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/513269/5132690316.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2015","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/513269/5132690315.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2014","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/513269/5132690314.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2013","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/513269/5132690313.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2012","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/513269/5132690312.pdf","source":"bse"}],"analysis":{"summary":"Man Industries published its earnings presentation for Q2 and H1 FY27, reporting strong growth in consolidated revenue, EBITDA, and PAT. Management highlighted key operational updates including the full quarter contribution from National Pipe Company in Saudi Arabia, progress on upcoming greenfield expansions in Jammu and Dammam, and real estate monetization through a joint development agreement with Paradise Group. The company maintains an order book of approximately Rs 3,500 crore executable over the next 6 to 9 months. Man Industries reported its Q1 FY27 financial performance, highlighted by record consolidated and standalone quarterly EBITDA and PAT alongside strong revenue growth. Management noted a structural multiyear demand shift in end markets driven by government and national oil company investments in energy and water infrastructure, supported by a growing global order book and bid pipeline.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"Management anticipates 25% to 30% minimum growth for FY28.","quote":"And I'm saying this would be the minimum growth, 25% to 30%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-09-01","url":"https://mangroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Concall-Transcript_12.08.2026.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"Management stated that the current demand across markets represents a structural multiyear shift rather than a one-off up cycle.","quote":"What we are seeing across our markets isn't a one-off up cycle. It's a structural multiyear shift.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-09-01","url":"https://mangroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Concall-Transcript_12.08.2026.pdf"},{"claim":"The combined bid pipeline stands at approximately INR24,000 crores.","quote":"Beyond that, our combined bid pipeline stands at approximately INR24,000 crores, giving us a substantial base for future order inflows.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-09-01","url":"https://mangroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Concall-Transcript_12.08.2026.pdf"},{"claim":"There is currently a shortfall between demand and supply in Saudi Arabia which is expected to continue for the next 3 to 4 years.","quote":"Currently, there is a shortfall of between demand and supply. So supply is lower and demand is higher. And we expect this to continue for the next 3 to 4 years, looking at the current -- with the war scenario and everything, a lot of new projects, the East-West line, the Master Gas expansion.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-09-01","url":"https://mangroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Concall-Transcript_12.08.2026.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"Operations at the Dammam coating and double jointing facility are targeted to commence by March 2027.","quote":"On our upcoming Dammam coating and double jointing facility, this further strengthens our integrated manufacturing, value-added processing capabilities in Kingdom with operations targeted to commence by March '27.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-09-01","url":"https://mangroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Concall-Transcript_12.08.2026.pdf"},{"claim":"Construction of the Jammu greenfield stainless project remains on track with production expected by March 2027.","quote":"On our Jammu greenfield stainless project, construction remains on track with production expected by March '27.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-09-01","url":"https://mangroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Concall-Transcript_12.08.2026.pdf"},{"claim":"The Dammam coating plant involves an investment of USD50 million, funded partly by a loan of USD25 million and USD25 million from internal accruals.","quote":"Then we are putting up a coating plant in Saudi that is going on, which is around USD50 million investment, which will be funded partly by loan, USD25 million, USD25 million, we will do from our own.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-09-01","url":"https://mangroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Concall-Transcript_12.08.2026.pdf"},{"claim":"The Jammu project involves a total outlay of INR600 crores with a loan component of INR389 crores.","quote":"And Jammu project, which is going on for INR600 crores, the loan component will be INR389 crores and balance our component, we have already invested in the project so far.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-09-01","url":"https://mangroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Concall-Transcript_12.08.2026.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"Standalone PBT for Q2 FY27 includes an exceptional item comprising the write-back of customer advance of approximately Rs 25 crore consequent to the settlement of a sales contract worth approximately Rs 38 crore.","quote":"^There is exceptional item in profit before tax, which comprise the write-back of customer advance of ~₹ 25 crore consequent to the settlement of a sales contract worth ~₹ 38 crore.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=a351fb3c-f86e-4493-afdc-3496f923da39.pdf"},{"claim":"Standalone revenue grew 37.5% year-on-year with EBITDA margin expanding 450 basis points to 15.3%.","quote":"On a stand-alone basis, revenue grew 37.5% year-on-year to INR1,028 crores. EBITDA grew 95.1% year-on-year to INR157 crores, with EBITDA margin expanding 450 basis points to 15.3%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-09-01","url":"https://mangroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Concall-Transcript_12.08.2026.pdf"},{"claim":"Consolidated EBITDA reached INR155 crores, up 92.6% year-on-year.","quote":"On the consolidated basis, we delivered our highest ever consolidated quarterly EBITDA of INR155 crores, which is up 92.6% year-on-year and 5% quarter-on-quarter, driven by the strategic optimized product and geographic mix and continued deepening of our global order pipeline.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-09-01","url":"https://mangroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Concall-Transcript_12.08.2026.pdf"},{"claim":"The full financial impact and earnings contribution from NPC are expected to be reflected from Q2 FY27 onwards.","quote":"The full financial impact and earnings contribution from NPC are expected to be reflected from Q2 FY27 onwards.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-09-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=77e49d9f-1b07-4dd0-9b72-b5945c81e6ea.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"The consolidated order book stands at approximately INR3,600 crores across India and Saudi Arabia.","quote":"Our consolidated order book stands at approximately INR3,600 crores across India and Saudi Arabia, with the majority executable order over the next 6 to 12 months, giving us a strong revenue visibility into the rest of FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-09-01","url":"https://mangroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Concall-Transcript_12.08.2026.pdf"},{"claim":"Capacity utilization in India is approximately 50% to 60%.","quote":"Capacity utilization is approximately when you talk about India, is around 50% to 60%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-09-01","url":"https://mangroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Concall-Transcript_12.08.2026.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"Merino Shelters project is set to launch around mid-September, bringing in cash revenues in FY27.","quote":"And the project is set to launch around mid of September. And this would further bring in the cash revenues to the company in FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-09-01","url":"https://mangroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Concall-Transcript_12.08.2026.pdf"},{"claim":"Management anticipates INR35 crores to INR50 crores in cash inflows from Merino Shelters in the current financial year.","quote":"Merino Shelters also, as Mr. Nikhil ji just mentioned, has got the RERA certification received and project is getting launched next month, we are anticipating INR50 crores -- INR35 crores to INR50 crores cash inflows in this current financial year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-09-01","url":"https://mangroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Concall-Transcript_12.08.2026.pdf"},{"claim":"National Pipe Company acquisition was financed through a mix of USD 70 million debt and USD 32 million equity.","quote":"Equity USD 32 Mn Debt USD 70 Mn TOTAL USD 102 Mn","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-09-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=77e49d9f-1b07-4dd0-9b72-b5945c81e6ea.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"Production at the Dammam coating plant in Saudi Arabia is targeted for March 2027.","quote":"Dammam Coating Plant (KSA)-Production Targeted : March’2027","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=a351fb3c-f86e-4493-afdc-3496f923da39.pdf","timeframe":"March 2027"},{"claim":"Operations at the Dammam coating and double jointing facility are targeted to commence by March 2027.","quote":"On our upcoming Dammam coating and double jointing facility, this further strengthens our integrated manufacturing, value-added processing capabilities in Kingdom with operations targeted to commence by March '27.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-09-01","url":"https://mangroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Concall-Transcript_12.08.2026.pdf","timeframe":"March '27"},{"claim":"Production at the Jammu greenfield stainless project is expected by March 2027.","quote":"On our Jammu greenfield stainless project, construction remains on track with production expected by March '27.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-09-01","url":"https://mangroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Concall-Transcript_12.08.2026.pdf","timeframe":"March '27"},{"claim":"Merino Shelters project is set to launch around the middle of September.","quote":"And the project is set to launch around mid of September.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-09-01","url":"https://mangroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Concall-Transcript_12.08.2026.pdf","timeframe":"mid of September"},{"claim":"Cash inflows from Merino Shelters are anticipated to be INR35 crores to INR50 crores in the current financial year.","quote":"Merino Shelters also, as Mr. Nikhil ji just mentioned, has got the RERA certification received and project is getting launched next month, we are anticipating INR50 crores -- INR35 crores to INR50 crores cash inflows in this current financial year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-09-01","url":"https://mangroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Concall-Transcript_12.08.2026.pdf","timeframe":"current financial year"},{"claim":"The Dammam Coating Plant in KSA is targeted for production by March 2027.","quote":"Dammam Coating Plant (KSA)- Production Targeted: Mar’2027","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-09-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=77e49d9f-1b07-4dd0-9b72-b5945c81e6ea.pdf","timeframe":"Mar’2027"},{"claim":"The Jammu Stainless Steel Plant is targeted for production starting March 2027.","quote":"Jammu Stainless Steel Plant- Production Targeted: Mar’2027","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-09-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=77e49d9f-1b07-4dd0-9b72-b5945c81e6ea.pdf","timeframe":"Mar’2027"},{"claim":"Expected cashflow of Rs. 35-50 Cr is anticipated in FY27 from the real estate project.","quote":"Expected Rs. 35-50Cr Cashflow in FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-09-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=77e49d9f-1b07-4dd0-9b72-b5945c81e6ea.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"}],"coverage":{"docs_analysed":3,"kinds":["concall_ppt","concall_transcript"]}},"_meta":{"model":"gemini-3.6-flash","grounded":true,"facts_kept":25,"facts_dropped_ungrounded":24,"note":"Facts are verbatim-grounded against the company's own documents; claims whose quote was not found were dropped."}}